Console font: koi8x16 (8x16 bitmap glyphs used by the framebuffer console)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The glyph data in sys/dev/font8x16.c is derived from the koi8x16 font of the
X.Org font-misc-cyrillic package, which is distributed with the statement
"May be distributed and modified without restrictions." The data is converted
by tools/gen_font.py; only ASCII 0x20-0x7E is used.
